pstack and verification-skill-example
-------------------------------------
The verify skill and its feature map (ADR 0017) follow pstack's
create-verification-skill and maintain-verification-skill skills and
poteto/verification-skill-example (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Lauren Tan):
- the skill's sections (Launch, Doctor, Drive, Evidence, Cleanup) and the
  feature map's shape (a README index with baseline preconditions, driving
  conventions and a feature entry contract; one file per feature with the four
  H2s Sub-features, How to get to it (user POV), Driving it with …, Gotchas),
  in src/verify/skill.ts, src/verify/map.ts and roles/qa.md;
- the maintain pass (index hygiene, source per feature, one live pass, triage
  into doc drift, harness gap or product regression) in roles/maintain.md and
  src/verify/run.ts;
- the proof standards in the generated SKILL.md and roles/sweep.md.
